    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check Out Our New Game</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Buckle up, pilot! We're stationed above an alien planet surrounded with an abandoned <strong>mining system</strong> and filled with alien bugs. Your mission? Dive into the tamed sectors, use the mining system <strong>to collect upgrade parts</strong> and <strong>extract the Bioshards</strong> from alien minerals. Beware\u2014 the system is infested with alien bug cells <strong>spreading and waiting to hatch.</strong> Stay quick on your feet, and you might just make it out in one piece!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375900/extras/fab26e8abcf69d15376c3112694a2c46.poster.avif?t=1734691424\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375900/extras/fab26e8abcf69d15376c3112694a2c46.webm?t=1734691424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375900/extras/fab26e8abcf69d15376c3112694a2c46.mp4?t=1734691424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BEWARE OF THE SWARM</h2><br>At the start of every expedition, <strong>the map is procedurally generated</strong>, and it's crawling with alien bugs. The cells constantly <strong>spread and evolve.</strong> When triggered, <strong>the bugs burst out from the cells</strong> to swarm you down!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375900/extras/5543989cf6d905d4f761ad77fa3d7000.poster.avif?t=1734691424\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375900/extras/5543989cf6d905d4f761ad77fa3d7000.webm?t=1734691424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375900/extras/5543989cf6d905d4f761ad77fa3d7000.mp4?t=1734691424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE TO BUILD SYNERGIES</h2><br>Equip up to five skills each run: active ones that strike automatically or passive ones that boost your abilities. Upgrade each skill differently to <strong>maximize their potential.</strong> Discover <strong>unique synergies</strong> between skills and upgrades to optimize your build. The better your synergies, the easier you'll crush enemies!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375900/extras/f61327b0bcb9ae07296dd4f84bf4397b.poster.avif?t=1734691424\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375900/extras/f61327b0bcb9ae07296dd4f84bf4397b.webm?t=1734691424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375900/extras/f61327b0bcb9ae07296dd4f84bf4397b.mp4?t=1734691424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique horde trigger mechanic<br></li><li>3 characters with rank missions<br></li><li>3 maps with 7 evolution difficulties<br></li><li>14 skills with 120+ unique upgrades<br></li><li>8 Gadgets<br></li><li>19 items with rarities<br></li><li>10 enemy varieties with 2 bosses<br></li><li>Operator<br></li><li>25+ achievements</li></ul><br>",
